      "stability_scope": "compose/mobile is a non-attached local composer, not a machine-readable report surface. The top-level sanitized-output-only policy applies to displayed scrollback only. The composer layout is best-effort, while the displayed capture text is a stable sanitized-capture-display sub-surface. The display resolves targets like logs and captures the last --tail sanitized lines (default 80); --once captures once before commit, while interactive mode refreshes on --refresh (default 500ms), local input, and terminal resize. Committed text is sent through the existing input/send path: default commits append Enter (carriage return), --no-enter sends exact message bytes, interactive Enter uses the same default rule even for an empty buffer, and compose must not subscribe to attach, resize, or alter attached-client counts or PTY geometry."
